This plugin does not bundle a speech recognition engine. Transcription is
performed on your machine by Voxtype (https://voxtype.io, MIT), which Omarchy
installs with `omarchy voxtype install`, using whisper.cpp models published by
the whisper.cpp project (https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp, MIT).

The bar widget follows the structure of Omarchy's own shell plugins
(https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy, MIT).
